  "description": "The Sphere compromises existing residential blocks of 8 and 10 storeys, with a ground floor commercial space fronting Silverton Way and a lower ground car parking area. The buildings have flat roofs, and balconies are present on all elevations.\nInvestigations have identified combustible materials within the  external wall types and balcony components, as well as an overall lack of adequate fire barriers within certain cavity wall areas.  The proposed works  involve the removal and replacement of these elements with non-combustible materials and the installation of appropriate fire barriers to achieve compliance with current fire safety standards.\nWhere facing materials are replaced, the proposed finishes will closely match the existing materials and colours to maintain the present architectural appearance of the development.\nIn summary, the proposal is a  recladding project incorporating essential fire safety improvements.\n",
